🧠 Practice Tips
●	*Daily Coding Practice: Dedicate at least 30 minutes daily to solve problems on platforms like LeetCode or HackerRank, focusing on Python and SL.

●	*Project Documentation: Maintain a GitHub repository documenting your projects, including code, README files, and sample outpus.

●	*Code Reviews: Regularly review and refactor your code to improve readability and efficieny.

