Python & PySpark Skill-Building Roadmap for Data Engineering
________________________________________
Phase 1 (Weeks 1–2): Python Foundations – "Write Code, Not Chaos"
🔧 Focus Areas
●	Variables, Loops, Functions, Data Structures (Lists, Dicts, Sets)

●	File I/O, Exception Handling, Logging

●	OOP basics

●	Virtual environments, pip, and requirements.txt

🎯 Projects
●	Build a basic log parser that reads log files and summarizes error types.

●	Create a CLI CSV cleaner that handles nulls, whitespace, and formatting.

